mapping "L533A.1" source="L533A" target="201382007" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source L533A SNOMED CT 201382007 = erythema figuratum perstans, a chronic figurate erythema. No
        dedicated SNOMED CT concept in the mirror; the closest standard concept is SNOMED CT 40397940 /
        201382007, the ICD-10 L53.3 rubric that subsumes erythema figuratum perstans. Same rubric, but
        the source is one specific entity within that rubric — read as exact at the ICD-10-rubric level.
        Confidence capped at because the target is an ICD-10-indexing concept, not an unqualified
        clinical equivalent.
        """
}
